People's Mesh Kit: licensing summary

1. Guide text, BOM, handouts and scripts in this repository (everything not
   listed below) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Credit: "People's Mesh Kit" contributors, based on designs by Black Flag Civilian.

2. stl/ and images/: "The People's Companion" and "The People's Repeater" by
   Black Flag Civilian, published on Printables (models 1832924 and 1768397)
   under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication):
   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

3. firmware/ and sources/meshcore-docs/: MeshCore (https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore), MIT License,
   Copyright (c) the MeshCore contributors. The OTAFIX bootloader is by @oltaco,
   redistributed from https://flasher.meshcore.io/firmware/; the QSPIFlash
   formatter is by @recrof (MIT). See the upstream projects for full license text.

5. offline-flasher/config-site/: mirror of https://config.meshcore.io
   (meshcore-dev/config.meshcore.io, MIT License). offline-flasher/serve.py is
   CC BY 4.0 like the rest of this repo's own code.

6. Not in git, rebuilt locally by scripts/update_offline_flasher.py:
   offline-flasher/site/ (mirror of flasher.meshcore.io; no published license)
   and offline-extras/ (MeshCore apps by Liam Cottle; free, not open source).

4. sources/transcripts/ is git-ignored: the auto-generated captions of Black
   Flag Civilian's videos stay local for reference and are not redistributed.
